<h2>Asobi Review 0.2 (build 478)</h2>
<p><b>A taller playlist shows more shots.</b></p>
<ul>
<li><b>Fixed: the floating playlist ignored the window height.</b> Widening it worked, but making it taller just added empty panel above and below a five-row list. The list now takes the height it's given — a 13-shot conform fits on screen at once — and the content sits at the top instead of floating in the middle.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
